<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria c.bank to up main rate to 5.50pct-dealers.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria c.bank to up main rate to 5.50pct-dealers.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank (BNB) will raise its main lev interest rate to 5.50 percent from 5.42 percent, effective Monday, bank dealers said on Thursday.</p>
